  "display_name": "Microsoft Teams",
  "config_schema": {
   "additionalProperties": false,
   "description": "`customer_notification_route.config` when channel='teams'.\n\nOne field, which is the point — a channel this simple should need no\nfrontend work, and the generic renderer handles it.",
